<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 73.7094 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 73.7094 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 73.7094 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday from 73.5080 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 9		   Dec 6</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.7094		 73.5080</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	     7.545		   7.785</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 8 3272 509410</p>
